      "lines": [
        "579. 每年全世界木材生长量为16亿立方米，采伐量为24亿",
        "立方米. 采伐木材的31%用于造纸. 木材的采伐量比",
        "每年的生长量多百分之几？多少木材用于造纸？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "580",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "580. 计算：",
        "$(16.583:7.21+54.688:3.2+28.82\\cdot0.1):1.6-1.02$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "32. 合并同类项"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在和$2a-6a+10a$中，所有加数都有一个共同的因数$a$. ",
        "根据乘法分配律，这个和可写成：",
        "$2a-6a+10a=a\\cdot(2-6+10)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们把共同因数$a$提到了括号外边. 在括号里边写的是各项",
        "系数的和. 这个和等于6：",
        "$2-6+10=6$.",
        "所以　　$2a-6a+10a=6a$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$2a,-6a,+10a$各项有相同的字母部分. 这些项就叫做",
        "**同类项**. 用$6a$代替式$2a-6a+10a$叫做**合并同类项**. 各同类",
        "项之间只是数字系数不同."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**合并同类项，要把同类项的系数相加，并把所得的和乘以**",
        "**公共的字母部分.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
